{"text": "The widespread use of online games and esports is based on a combination of technological, sociocultural, and economic factors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Primarily, the global strengthening of internet infrastructure and the increase of high speed connectivity have made it possible for players from different regions to connect in real time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Improvements in computer hardware, game consoles, and mobile devices have increased user interest by offering high resolution graphics, smooth gaming experiences, and advanced interaction capabilities. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The rise of social media and live streaming platforms has enabled gaming and esports events to reach wider audiences, transforming players into not only participants but also content creators and viewers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Social media content is enormously diverse, reflecting creators and viewers interests in sports, entertainment, and social issues. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Competition, reward systems, and professional tournament organizations have transformed esports into an attractive career field, strengthening its economic dimension through sponsorship and advertising revenues. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Furthermore, the social interaction, teamwork, and sense of belonging offered by online games are powerful attractions, especially among younger generations.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "d", "e", "s", "p", "r", "e", "a", "d", " ", "u", "s", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "o", "n", "l", "i", "n", "e", " ", "g", "a", "m", "e", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "e", "s", "p", "o", "r", "t", "s", " ", "i", "s", " ", "b", "a", "s", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "c", "o", "m", "b", "i", "n", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "e", "c", "h", "n", "o", "l", "o", "g", "i", "c", "a", "l", ",", " ", "s", "o", "c", "i", "o", "c", "u", "l", "t", "u", "r", "a", "l", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "e", "c", "o", "n", "o", "m", "i", "c", 